        "warning": "",
        "description": "<div class=\"\"><i>If you used LiveContainer, then to save progress in applications/games, put FlecDeck on top (do not delete LiveContainer)</i>.</div><div class=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"\">Run your apps inside FlekDeck — a powerful app environment designed to feel like a second operating system.</div><div><br></div><div>FlekDeck brings a familiar Home Screen, built-in multitasking, fast app switching, a dedicated Installer, and extensive customization into one seamless experience.</div><div><br></div><div>Discover and install apps from your repositories, run multiple apps at the same time, customize your workspace, and switch between apps just like you’re used to on iOS.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"\">Built on LiveContainer and reimagined from the ground up, FlekDeck also includes dozens of compatibility and stability improvements for hundreds of apps.</div><div class=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/flekstore/FlekDeck/\">FlekDeck repo</a></div><div class=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/LiveContainer/LiveContainer\">LiveContainer repo</a></div><div><br></div>",
