      "detail": {
        "id": 860,
        "icon": "https://flekstore.com/img-storage/apps/860/VCUS_icon.png",
        "name": "VCUS",
        "developer": "Dangerous Pixel",
        "version": "2.0.222",
        "install_url": "VCUS.ipa",
        "photos": [
          "https://flekstore.com/img-storage/apps/860/VCUS1.jpg",
          "https://flekstore.com/img-storage/apps/860/VCUS2.jpg",
          "https://flekstore.com/img-storage/apps/860/VCUS3.jpg",
          "https://flekstore.com/img-storage/apps/860/VCUS4.png"
        ],
        "warning": "",
        "description": "&nbsp; &nbsp; VCUS is a stunning, easy-to-use editing application for Instagram Stories. We aim to provide our users with a creative, dynamic editing experience so you can create Stories for any type of business, with features that match the latest online styles and trends. Even if you are not a professional video editor, you can easily create captivating short videos with VCUS. More importantly, we created VCUS to be your key to achieving success with your business.<div><br><div></div><div></div><div class=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; In the newest version of VCUS, we have added many new features, such as dynamic Story templates, scheduled posts, highlight cover creation, and portrait beautification and makeup effects. We also upgraded the video editing experience and added text stickers, filters, transitions, and other features to make VCUS easier to use.\r</div><div class=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"\">• Animated Story Templates: More than 500 refined, professional video templates, perfect for restaurants, clothing stores, online services and many other commercial scenarios, to meet all your video needs.\r</div><div>• Slo-Mo Shooting: Cool slow-motion effects can give your videos a fresh, exciting look, and make it easier to create great videos and generate advertising ideas in seconds.\r</div><div>• A huge amount of music: We have added a ton of high-quality commercial use music for you to apply to your videos, with a large variety of music genres available.\r</div><div>• Scheduled Posts: VCUS can be your personal assistant, helping you easily schedule posts for the best marketing times to effectively increase the number of views for your Stories.\r</div><div>• Highlight Covers: We’ve included lots of exclusive, hand-drawn, matching cover designs for you to use, so you can always find suitable Highlight Covers for your Instagram Highlights.\r</div><div>• All-in-one video editing features: Segmenting, video speed, reverse, mirroring effects, and more rich video editing features to make your creative dreams come true.\r</div><div>• Portrait Beautification &amp; Makeup: Our fine skin retouching effects can make your skin look flawless, and our trendy virtual makeup, in a variety of styles, can help your beauty be highlighted in a more natural way.\r</div><div>• Text Animation &amp; Stickers: Interesting and creative sticker and text effects to help you add some fun and draw more attention to your Story.</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div></div>",
